\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of this thesis's three contributions. (a)~Within the nonexistent category ($n = 600$), the largest and most practically relevant category, prompts that cause hallucination occupy sparser embedding neighborhoods than those answered correctly ($p < 0.001$, both models); full within-category results appear in Chapter~\ref {ch:geo-predict-hallucination}. (b)~Targeted system-prompt interventions reduce hallucination rates by up to 89\%. (c)~Fine-tuned models transfer epistemic caution to TruthfulQA, an unseen external benchmark, with significant improvement for Llama ($p < 0.01$).}}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:intro-overview}{{1.1}{4}{Overview of this thesis's three contributions. (a)~Within the nonexistent category ($n = 600$), the largest and most practically relevant category, prompts that cause hallucination occupy sparser embedding neighborhoods than those answered correctly ($p < 0.001$, both models); full within-category results appear in Chapter~\ref {ch:geo-predict-hallucination}. (b)~Targeted system-prompt interventions reduce hallucination rates by up to 89\%. (c)~Fine-tuned models transfer epistemic caution to TruthfulQA, an unseen external benchmark, with significant improvement for Llama ($p < 0.01$)}{figure.caption.4}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces A single prompt traced through the three-stage pipeline. At baseline, Mixtral~8x7B fabricates a detailed description of a nonexistent monument. With an Entity-Aware system prompt, the model correctly identifies the entity as nonexistent. After fine-tuning on curated prompt-response pairs --- with no system prompt at runtime --- the model exhibits the same cautious behavior, now embedded in its weights.}}{5}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline-example}{{1.2}{5}{A single prompt traced through the three-stage pipeline. At baseline, Mixtral~8x7B fabricates a detailed description of a nonexistent monument. With an Entity-Aware system prompt, the model correctly identifies the entity as nonexistent. After fine-tuning on curated prompt-response pairs --- with no system prompt at runtime --- the model exhibits the same cautious behavior, now embedded in its weights}{figure.caption.5}{}}
